{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30904","headline":"送李侍御福建从事 · 马戴","name":"送李侍御福建从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晋安来越国，蔓草故宫迷。\n钓渚龙应在，琴台鹤乱栖。\n泛涛明月广，边海衆山齐。\n宾府通兰棹，蛮僧接石梯。\n片云和瘴湿，孤屿映帆低。\n上客多诗兴，秋猨足夜啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}